From bip@nostromo.ens.fr Sat Jul 19 18:46:11 1997
Message-ID: <199707192243.AAA16029@nostromo.ens.fr>
Date: Sun, 20 Jul 1997 00:43:27 +0200
From: Thomas Pornin <bip@nostromo.ens.fr>
Subject: Re: HDD advice for UDB
